To build and compile this;

Package and update the service;

cd ../
mvn clean package install -DskipTests

cd server/

# run server in background for generation of open api specs
mvn spring-boot:run -DskipTests &&

# update open api specs from code
mvn clean verify -DskipTests

# install
mvn clean install -DskipTests

## Documentation

pip install plantuml graphviz

